	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_3">
		<text>Monolith... He left us.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_4">
		<text>And yesterday was water from the skies... Wet. Cold. I am cold.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_5">
		<text>But the first from Monolith came and said: "Come to your senses.". But they listened not.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_6">
		<text>Monolith. Monolith. Return to the abandoned children of yours.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_7">
		<text>And on the day, when worthy one would be found, Monolith will return.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_8">
		<text>I need. Need to remember. Monolith. Assist me.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_9">
		<text>Do not leave me, Monolith. Do not leave us, your children.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_10">
		<text>Monolith is light and knowledge, knowledge and light, He will return, will return.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_11">
		<text>The time will come, chosen ones will be saved, Monolith will give them perfection.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_12">
		<text>Trust nobody except Monolith and brothers of yours. Nobody.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_13">
		<text>Enemies are nearby. That is the will of Monolith.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_14">
		<text>We know what do they want, but we will fulfill our purpose: we will protect the Monolith. He will return and will be happy. He will be happy, we will be happy.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_15">
		<text>They planned to catch us unprepared, but great Monolith gave us the power, opened our eyes.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_16">
		<text>Monolith, why did You leave us? We cry, we wait.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_17">
		<text>Monolith, Your children are waiting for You, for Your wisdom, for Your power, for Your light.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_18">
		<text>We are strong by Your will, Monolith. You directed us, You gave us power to see and know. Why don't we hear Your voice?</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_19">
		<text>Monolith...</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_20">
		<text>Monolith. Great Monolith.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_21">
		<text>*cough*</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_22">
		<text>*cough*</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_idle_idle_23">
		<text>*cough*</text>
	</string>
	
	<!--states/loot-->
	
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_bad_1">
		<text>There is nothing for servants of Monolith.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_bad_2">
		<text>Monolith did not acquire anything here.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_bad_3">
		<text>There is no benefit for Monolith.</text>
	</string>
	
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_begin_1">
		<text>Equipment. For living servants of Monolith.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_begin_2">
		<text>Unneeded for ones passed. Will be taken by one alive.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_begin_3">
		<text>"Not every item's end is near" — said Monolith.</text>
	</string>
	
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_good_1">
		<text>Everything for the good of Monolith.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_good_2">
		<text>It's for the Monolith.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="as_sub_characters_voice_human_monolith_3_states_loot_loot_good_3">
		<text>May Monolith be reinforced with this.</text>
	</string>
	
